---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../site.config';
const updated = 'November 19, 2026';
---

<PageLayout title={`Privacy Policy | ${SITE.name}`} heading="Privacy Policy" description={`How ${SITE.name} collects, uses and protects your information.`}>
  <p><em>Last updated: {updated}</em></p>
  <p>This Privacy Policy explains how {SITE.name} ("we", "us") handles information when you visit {SITE.url}.</p>

  <h2>Information we collect</h2>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>Usage data:</strong> pages visited, time on page, device and browser type, collected via Google Analytics.</li>
    <li><strong>Contact data:</strong> name and email you provide when using our contact form.</li>
    <li>
      <strong>Local storage:</strong> your reading progress, theme and font preferences are stored only in your browser and are never sent
      to us.
    </li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Cookies and advertising</h2>
  <p>
    We use Google AdSense to display ads. Third-party vendors, including Google, use cookies to serve ads based on your prior visits to
    this and other websites. Google's use of advertising cookies enables it and its partners to serve ads based on your visits to our site
    and/or other sites on the Internet.
  </p>
  <p>
    You may opt out of personalized advertising by visiting <a href="https://www.google.com/settings/ads" rel="nofollow noopener"
      >Google Ads Settings</a
    > or <a href="https://www.aboutads.info" rel="nofollow noopener">www.aboutads.info</a>. Learn more about
    <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites" rel="nofollow noopener">how Google uses data</a>.
  </p>
  <p>
    Visitors in the EEA, UK and Switzerland are shown a consent message and may choose whether to allow personalized advertising.
  </p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>
    Depending on your location (e.g. GDPR, CCPA), you may have the right to access, correct or delete personal data we hold about you.
    Contact us through our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Children's privacy</h2>
  <p>Our site is not directed at children under 13 and we do not knowingly collect their personal information.</p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Changes are posted on this page with a new "last updated" date.</p>
</PageLayout>
